itude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le14ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you make and respond to requests, remember to be polite!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Making Requests </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Responding to Requests </span>n\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you \u2026 ?<br /> Would \u2026  be okay?<br /> I was wondering if \u2026<br /> Could you \u2026 ?<br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, \u2026<br /> Certainly.<br /> Yes, of course.<br /> I'll see what I can do.<br />\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Can you tell me where baggage carousel 8 is?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Attendant</span>: Sure. It's across the hall, on your left."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "baggage carousel "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place in an airport where your luggage arrives"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My suitcase is not on the baggage carousel!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in an airport when you collect your luggage."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "oversized"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an item that is too big"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My bag is bigger than a regular suitcase, so it could be at the oversized luggage carousel."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fragile"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an object that can be easily broken or damaged"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you pack any fragile items in your bag?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "handler "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who takes luggage from a plane to the baggage carousel"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Boston Airport luggage handlers are the best in the country!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "breakable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an object that can be easily broken; fragile"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hope you have nothing breakable in your bag!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "carry-on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of luggage you do not have to check in at the airport "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I packed all the breakable items in my carry-on."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "conveyor belt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the moving band of the luggage carousel"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is no luggage left on the conveyor belt."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob02aud07"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Comparative and Superlative Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class =\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing.<br /> You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class =\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>  \t<li>you use <span class =\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives </li> \t<li>you add <span class =\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things</li> </ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and superlative:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" small\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" smaller (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the smallest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"big\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bigger (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the biggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"safe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"safer (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the safest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"careful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more careful (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most careful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br />bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)<br /> worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br />the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"far\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"farther (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the farthest\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Attendant</span>: Is it your bag?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: No, it isn't. My bag is smaller than this one."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph (8-10 lines) about a typical day in the life of a luggage handler. Write about what the job requires."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online and make a list of oversized or fragile items that the handler must carry carefully."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use comparative adjectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about travel and transportation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use comparative adjectives to describe two objects."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about a workplace and a person's job."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob02re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le14ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi, I have another question ...<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Certainly. What can I do for you?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can't find my bag anywhere! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Let me see \u2026 your bag should be at baggage carousel number 8.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know. I looked and looked, but it's not on the conveyor belt.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Could you describe it for me?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure. It's a big red bag. It has a brown tag with my name on it.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Here's a red bag on the floor. Is that it?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: No. This one is quite small. Mine is bigger.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Ok \u2026   In that case, it could be at the oversized luggage carousel.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Can you tell me where that luggage carousel is?", "id": 2, "time": "18000", "image": "engenn5le14ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Of course. It's across the hall. What did you pack in your bag?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: A lot of presents for my family, souvenirs from Africa, that kind of thing ...<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Is there anything fragile? The handlers aren't the most careful in the country.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Oh no! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: You should put breakable items in your carry-on next time. It's safer.", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn5le14ob02re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type